    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong stance. but what about the human rights side? some people argue that giving states that much power is basically just a way to justify censorship and crack down on political dissent. isn't there a huge risk that \"social stability\" just becomes a cover for authoritarianism?",
